<title>LATVIA: Latvia March inflation 0.4 pct, yr/yr 8.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Latvia March inflation 0.4 pct, yr/yr 8.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inflation in Latvia rose 0.4 percent in March compared with February and was up 8.7 percent compared with March 1996, the statistics committee said on Monday.</p>
<p> LATVIAN INFLATION	     March '97   Feb '97   March '96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct) +0.4	  +0.4	+1.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)   +8.7	  +9.8	+20.2</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
